petrus-postgres
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package supports the Haskell port of Petrus (see UPSTREAM.md at the
repository root). It is the PostgreSQL layer the PostgreSQL components
share, shaped after how the pinned reference drives PostgreSQL through
psycopg 3; its test suite runs the same statements through psycopg and
compares the results.

